        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Prefer `&str` over `&String` in parameters",
            "Prefer `&[T]` over `&Vec<T>`",
            "Deref coercion makes both strictly more general"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Moving In A Loop",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "rust",
          "lines": [
            "for _ in 0..3 {",
            "    consume(s); // E0382 on pass 2",
            "}"
          ],
          "note": "value gone after iteration one"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Borrow instead: `fn consume(s: &str)`",
            "Clone per pass: `consume(s.clone())`",
            "Or move the single call out of the loop"
          ],
          "style": "check"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Returning References"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "rust",
          "lines": [
