          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "An output `&` must ==borrow from an input==",
            "No input to tie it to → E0106 missing lifetime",
            "`&local` fails — the local dies at return",
            "Fix: return the owned `String` instead"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Which Signature?"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Job",
            "Signature"
