          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Glue And Order"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "After your body runs, the compiler drops every field",
            "Outer value first, then its fields in declaration order",
            "Nested resources therefore free automatically",
            "`Vec<T>` drops every element, then frees its buffer"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flow",
          "spec": {
            "nodes": [
